{"c":[{"id":"8d80c56c1ac8210e","sum":"Add-a-model checklist includes model AGENTS.md; root README lists no models. Do not test Cults User-Agent (change detector).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T154954Z-18a69cbe885816c7","text":"Supersedes the checklist-gap note: the Add-a-model checklist now has the model AGENTS.md step. The root README lists no models on purpose; the directories are the list.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T155147Z-711ba3dd8db79ebf","text":"Do not test the Cults User-Agent string. Asserting the header, or that Python-urllib is absent, is a change detector.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"82b21961bd137392","sum":"CadQuery: Workplane.section(z) follows the workplane normal (an XZ revolve slices along y); an area at height z is a thin slab. Shapely polylines bloat STEP and coincident cones are invalid; use true circles and offset touching cones by 0.2.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261015T175712Z-186d790bde4ed5d2","text":"CadQuery: Workplane.section(z) slices along the normal of the workplane the solid came from (a revolve on XZ slices along y). To get an area at height z, intersect a thin slab.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261015T175712Z-8a9b068da52fc102","text":"CadQuery: shapes from shapely polylines bloat STEP (4 MB vs 320 KB) and coincident cones make invalid solids; build from true circles and offset touching cones by 0.2.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
